<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>The Use of Large Language Models (LLMs)</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">During the preparation of this manuscript, Large Language Models were used as a general-purpose writing assistant tool. Specifically, LLMs were employed to polish the language and refine the clarity of the text. The authors take full responsibility for the content of the paper.</p>
</div>
</section>
